"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"A source identifies the current along the Norwegian coast and represents it with stations 1 and 5 nautical miles off Torungen; this is a section location, not a whole-current length. Its relation to the name Norwegian Current is convention-dependent.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:algerian","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:algerian","illustrated_span_km":null,"illustrated_span_rank":null,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":null,"length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"The source describes a coastal current along Algeria that sheds mesoscale eddies; the atlas point is regional and does not define a start, end, or measured centerline.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:balearic","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:balearic","illustrated_span_km":null,"illustrated_span_rank":null,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":null,"length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"The source describes a branch of the Northern Current turning near 40.6\u00b0N and contributing to flow in front of Mallorca; no comparable whole-current length is given.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:western-adriatic","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:western-adriatic","illustrated_span_km":null,"illustrated_span_rank":null,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":null,"length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"Drifter evidence identifies a fast, coastally confined southeastward flow along the Italian Adriatic coast; the regional atlas point is not a measured centerline or length endpoint.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:baffin","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:baffin","illustrated_span_km":null,"illustrated_span_rank":null,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":null,"length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"The source identifies Baffin Island Current flow along western Baffin Bay; the atlas point is regional, with no source-defined whole-current centerline or length.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:mauritanian","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:mauritanian","illustrated_span_km":null,"illustrated_span_rank":null,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":null,"length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"The source reports poleward surface flow during the May\u2013July relaxation season in the Mauritanian upwelling region; winter upwelling-season coastal flow is equatorward. A single year-round direction or whole-current length would misrepresent this seasonal regime.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:gaspe","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:gaspe","illustrated_span_km":null,"illustrated_span_rank":null,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":null,"length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"The source places the jet along the Gasp\u00e9 Peninsula and reports a typical width of about 10\u201320 km near its strongest reach; width is not along-current length, and no comparable whole-current estimate is admitted.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:northern-mediterranean","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:northern-mediterranean","illustrated_span_km":null,"illustrated_span_rank":null,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":null,"length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"The named flow is described from the Ligurian Sea along the Proven\u00e7al and Catalan coasts. The cited paper reports widths and local sections, not a comparable whole-current alongstream length.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:ligurian","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:ligurian","illustrated_span_km":null,"illustrated_span_rank":null,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":null,"length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"The source describes a Northern Current formed in the Ligurian Sea that flows onward along the Proven\u00e7al and Balearic slopes; the Ligurian name is treated here as its source-region segment, without assigning the whole system's extent to this record.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:oyashio","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"gate_distance_sensitivity":null,"id":"length_assessment:oyashio","illustrated_span_km":2551,"illustrated_span_rank":15,"illustration_ledger_source_id":"source:3e0c99ee52e26d36","illustration_limit":"Drawn map-arrow span, not a physical current length or lower bound","illustration_source_id":"source:1dea75135bdc7c41","length_source_id":null,"length_source_locator":null,"lower_bound_km":null,"proposed_system_length_km":null,"published_length_km":null,"published_rank":null,"rank_eligible":false,"scope":"No comparable path-length estimate admitted yet.","source_id":"source:803229fe82eb2360"},{"entity_id":"current:somali","evidence_status":"no_numeric_length","gate_distance_method_source_id":null,"