 mainly within upper300 m; depth at which prose100 km span is evaluated is not separately specified. Reference level is shallower of750 m and local bottom, not a width layer.\",\n    \"time_convention\": \"Width paragraph explicitly uses19-23September2002 prestorm fields. Broader flight context18-23September; no width inferred for2October or4October. No source clock timezone assigned.\",\n    \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported cross-stream extent of geostrophic speeds at least0.4 m/s; preserve fixed cutoff. Approximate e-folding wording is source context, not an adopted relative threshold.\",\n    \"source_url\": \"https://scholarship.miami.edu/esploro/outputs/doctoral/Gulf-of-Mexico-Loop-Current-Mechanical/991031447487802976\",\n    \"source_citation\": \"Uhlhorn, E. W. (2008), Gulf of Mexico Loop Current Mechanical Energy and Vorticity Response to a Tropical Cyclone, PhD dissertation, University of Miami, May2008.\",\n    \"source_locator\": \"Section2.5.2, printed35-37/PDF64-66; width paragraph printed36/PDF65; Figure2.28 printed38/PDF67. Date/flight context printed10-11/PDF39-40. PDF page numbers include repository cover.\",\n    \"source_evidence_kind\": \"original_dissertation_observational_density_analysis\",\n    \"extraction_method\": \"Transcribed explicit about100 km prose after original-page and section review; no curve digitization or reconstruction from longitude ticks.\",\n    \"phase_label\": \"19-23 September2002 \\u00b7 prestorm geostrophic core\",\n    \"phase_kind\": \"campaign_geostrophic_core\",\n    \"observed_period\": {\n      \"start\": \"2002-09-19\",\n      \"end\": \"2002-09-23\"\n    },\n    \"source_quality_note\": \"Thermal-wind velocity relative to an assumed zero-reference level can underestimate absolute speed. Source e-folding wording is not numerically identical to the stated fixed cutoff. Width error and exact edge geometry remain unknown.\",\n    \"remaining_gates\": [\n      \"Recover paired geographic edges, exact width evaluation depth and numerical density/velocity profiles.\",\n      \"Review reference-flow, curvature, mapping resolution and boundary sensitivity before independent physical admission.\",\n      \"Acquire compatible repeated sections for seasonal or whole-current dimensions.\"\n    ],\n    \"original_regional_context\": {\n      \"description_kind\": \"loop_prestorm_fixed_speed_geostrophic_core\",\n      \"source_speed_threshold_m_s\": 0.4,\n      \"source_local_peak_context_m_s\": 0.75,\n      \"source_e_folding_wording_is_adopted_threshold\": false,\n      \"source_threshold_to_prose_peak_ratio\": 0.5333333333333333,\n      \"reference_depth_limit_m\": 750,\n      \"reference_condition\": \"zero geostrophic velocity at shallower of750 m and local bottom\",\n      \"reference_depth_is_width_layer\": false,\n      \"upper_core_depth_context_m\": 300,\n      \"core_depth_context_is_uniform_width_slab\": false,\n      \"source_width_period\": {\n        \"start\": \"2002-09-19\",\n        \"end\": \"2002-09-23\"\n      },\n      \"general_flight_period_context\": {\n        \"start\": \"2002-09-18\",\n        \"end\": \"2002-09-23\"\n      },\n      \"poststorm_current_change_is_width_change\": false,\n      \"speed_bias_is_width_error\": false,\n      \"source_curve_or_coordinates_digitized\": false,\n      \"display_aria_label\": \"Loop Current: about100 km author-reported fixed0.4 m/s geostrophic core span,19-23September2002. Relative reference flow, exact evaluation depth and geographic edges unresolved; no annual range.\",\n      \"display_caption\": \"About100 km \\u00b7 prestorm geostrophic core at fixed0.4 m/s cutoff.\",\n      \"display_method_note\": \"Thermal-wind density analysis relative to750 m or bottom. Upper300 m core context is not a uniform width layer. Source e-folding wording is not adopted; no width-error or seasonal interval.\",\n      \"comparison_figure\": \"figures/loop-uhlhorn-2008-core-width.svg\",\n      \"comparison_figure_label\": \"Inspect the Loop Current core width definition\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical"},{"current_id":"south-pacific","document":{"acquisition_file":"research/source-data/stramma-south-pacific-1995/acquisition.json","acquisition_sha256":"f526c22e6c9818083ce9aa6c4a0840c7731e5610a86bcb03e204897e3f7f301d","current_id":"south-pacific","figure_file":"figures/south-pacific-stramma-1990-band-constraint.svg","figure_sha256":"7b6e2df10289091c3f4072f6eb00caf46dc3fe49a59608e0f5de5b6b8e14fe45","measurement":{"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"approximate_width_km":null,"boundary_rule":"Author reports band less than200 km wide. No numeric edge cutoff or geographic edge pair supplied; peak/sampled velocities are context only.","calendar_months":null,"current_id":"south-pacific","extraction_method":"Source qualifier and context transcribed after visual review of original pages. No source curve or edge digitization.","fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"geographic_scope":"Western South Pacific near Chatham Rise; Baldrige section d at nominal170 W in March1990. Front station table gives170.6 W; exact width edges unresolved.","id":"south-pacific-stramma-1990-03-relative-band-constraint","is_confidence_interval":false,"layer":"Enhanced eastward relative-geostrophic band in Figure3 upper1000 m context. Surface-intensified flow; exact width-evaluation depth unknown. No uniform vertical width slab.","measurement_type":"published_month_relative_geostrophic_band_width_constraint","name":"South Pacific Current","observed_month":"1990-03","observed_period":null,"original_regional_context":{"axis_to_ACC_separation_km":{"is_current_width":false,"operator":"gt","value":500},"display_aria_label":"South Pacific Current: the authors report an enhanced eastward band less than 200 km wide near nominal 170 W in March 1990. Relative geostrophic reference sigma2=36.75 kg/m3 at 1800-1840 m. Representative width, exact days, lower bound and error unknown. No 200 km point, zero-to-200 interval, geographic width band or annual range.","display_caption":"March 1990 / Baldrige section d near nominal 170 W. Source-reported constraint for an enhanced eastward relative-geostrophic band; representative width and paired edges unknown.","display_method_note":"One reported less-than band constraint; representative width, lower bound, numerical uncertainty, mapped edges and annual extrema remain unknown. March 1990 dates the observation; 1995 is publication. The 100 km transport assumption and greater-than-500 km separation from ACC flow are distinct contextual values.","field_plot_context_is_uniform_width_layer":false,"field_plot_depth_context_m":[0,1000],"front_bracket_is_width_edges":false,"front_station_latitudes_degrees_north":[-43.5,-42.5],"front_table_longitude_degrees_east":-170.6,"illustrative_transport_width_is_observation":false,"illustrative_transport_width_km":100,"nominal_section_longitude_degrees_east":-170,"observed_month":"1990-03","relative_geostrophic_reference":{"potential_density_symbol":"sigma_2","reference_is_width_layer":false,"source_reference_depth_range_m":[1800,1840],"value_kg_m3":36.75},"source_quote":"less than 200 km wide","source_section":"d / RV Baldrige","source_velocity_context":{"near_500m_cm_s":4,"surface_peak_cm_s":7,"velocities_are_width_cutoffs":false}},"phase_kind":"month_dated_width_constraint","phase_label":"Baldrige enhanced eastward band / March 1990","range_interpretation":"Reported enhanced eastward band less than200 km in one historical section. Representative width, lower bound, confidence limits, whole-current envelope and annual range remain unknown.","range_kind":"author_reported_dated_less_than_width_constraint","remaining_gates":["Recover author boundary definition and exact evaluation depth before paired physical edges.","Acquire compatible repeated sections before seasonal widths or annual extrema.","Independent scientific admission."],"reported_width_constraint":{"i